        <item>
            <title>1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 08:15:43 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.4.0</h3>
<p><strong>New</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><em>Live data</em> buttons show anything that changes: a button runs a command or fetches a web address every so often and draws the result, with an optional chart. Use <em>Test</em> in the edit window to see exactly what it prints. A button only runs after you approve it, and importing a layout clears every approval.</li>
  <li>Example scripts for the weather, whether a website is up, what is on TV and smart-meter electricity are on the recipes page of the BarDeck website.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
